d $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "6facdf32-03e6-555c-810a-54cb2b210729" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/c7/c7f1c1301b6f38fe43e72dec939bba00c496790f90981663ca97dc7c2d2eb37f.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $2$ squares left and $4$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $1$ square left and $2$ squares up. Thus $OX=2|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=2\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $4$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square up. Thus $XC=4|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=4\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=2\\mathbf{a}+4\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=2$ and $\\mu=4$."] [:db/add "6facdf32-03e6-555c-810a-54cb2b210729" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "6facdf32-03e6-555c-810a-54cb2b210729" :question/answer-fields "20ba0dd4-3ff3-5622-b007-48317ee92b9f"] [:db/add "6facdf32-03e6-555c-810a-54cb2b210729" :question/answer-fields "ccb7092f-60ba-5d9a-9735-95bfeac23319"] [:db/ensure "6facdf32-03e6-555c-810a-54cb2b210729" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "6facdf32-03e6-555c-810a-54cb2b210729"] [:db/add "846450e2-0809-5602-9f18-f72b6d2d5a13" :answer/id #uuid "846450e2-0809-5602-9f18-f72b6d2d5a13"] [:db/add "846450e2-0809-5602-9f18-f72b6d2d5a13" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "846450e2-0809-5602-9f18-f72b6d2d5a13" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "846450e2-0809-5602-9f18-f72b6d2d5a13" :answer/validate] [:db/add "52ef17c2-d609-5803-a863-0c1a44a148cf" :answer-field/id #uuid "52ef17c2-d609-5803-a863-0c1a44