/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/f2/f2adc2fbce4da5ab84d93354e3ebb7a0dce5583a851327e9ee8cf0a32de7b0a7.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $2$ squares right. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $1$ square right. Thus $OX=2|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=2\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $3$ squares right and $3$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square right and $1$ square up. Thus $XC=3|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=3\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=2\\mathbf{a}+3\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=2$ and $\\mu=3$."] [:db/add "7986b070-a3c6-5cf9-840f-389a13fa3ca5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "7986b070-a3c6-5cf9-840f-389a13fa3ca5" :question/answer-fields "52ef17c2-d609-5803-a863-0c1a44a148cf"] [:db/add "7986b070-a3c6-5cf9-840f-389a13fa3ca5" :question/answer-fields "b6226e04-05ee-55ce-854c-49acd0570d17"] [:db/ensure "7986b070-a3c6-5cf9-840f-389a13fa3ca5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "7986b070-a3c6-5cf9-840f-389a13fa3ca5"] [:db/add "9d5a2579-90cf-5702-9598-a5b769e1d0ef" :answer/id #uuid "9d5a2579-90cf-5702-9598-a5b769e1d0ef"] [:db/add "9d5a2579-90cf-5702-9598-a5b769e1d0ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9d5a2579-90cf-5702-9598-a5b769e1d0ef" :answer/value "4"] [:db/ensure "9d5a2579-90cf-5702-9598-a5b769e1d0ef" :answer/validate] [:db/add "96bd2e09-5b0d-5e8a-9c02-3348f1013233" :answer-field/id #uuid "96bd2e09-5b0d-5e8a-9c02-3348f1013233"] [:db/add "96bd2e09-5b0d-5e8a-9c02-3348f1013233" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "96bd2e09-5b0d-5e8a-9c02-3348f1013233" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "96bd2e09-5b0d-5e8a-9c02-3348f1013233" :answer-field/choices "9d5a2579-90cf-5702-9598-a5b769e1d0ef"] [:db/add "96bd2e09-5b0d-5e8a-9c02-3348f1013233" :answer-field/correct "9d5a2579-90cf-5702-9598-a5b769e1d0ef"] [:db/ensure "96bd2e09-5b0d-5e8a-9c02-3348f1013233" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3e127166-b3cf-50af-ae9a-be296f29b037" :answer/id #uuid "3e127166-b3cf-50af-ae9a-be296f29b037"] [:db/add "3e127166-b3cf-50af-ae9a-be296f29b037" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3e127166-b3cf-50af-ae9a-be296f29b037" :answer/value "4"] [:db/ensure "3e127166-b3cf-50af-ae9a-be296f29b037" :answer/validate] [:db/add "771b5075-b99f-529e-9094-971809f385b4" :answer-field/id #uuid "771b5075-b99f-529e-9094-971809f385b4"] [:db/add "771b5075-b99f-529e-9094-971809f385b4" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "771b5075-b99f-529e-9094-971809f385b4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "771b5075-b99f-529e-9094-971809f385b4" :answer-field/choices "3e127166-b3cf-50af-ae9a-be296f29b037"] [:db/add "771b5075-b99f-529e-9094-971809f385b4" :answer-field/correct "3e127166-b3cf-50af-ae9a-be296f29b037"] [:db/ensure "771b5075-b99f-529e-9094-971809f385b4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f816033f-048c-54d4-9ea4-06b8674b75bc" :question/id #uuid "f816033f-048c-54d4-9ea4-06b8674b75bc"] [:db/add "f816033f-048c-54d4-9ea4-06b8674b75bc" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/31/31a393105a5a43223f2eda888b0696386f576cc21b1178450da3c5b3ff4feb52.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "f816033f-048c-54d4-9ea4-06b8674b75bc" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/95/95194113046c911e0418dd965a53f5661b942034f1055934c33891c7de99601c.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $8$ squares left. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares left. Thus $OX=4|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=4\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $8$ squares left and $4$ squares up. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $2$ squares left and $1$ square up. Thus $XC=4|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=4\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=4\\mathbf{a}+4\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=4$ and $\\mu=4$."] [:db/add "f816033f-048c-54d4-9ea4-06b8674b75bc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f816033f-048c-54d4-9ea4-06b8674b75bc" :question/answer-fields "96bd2e09-5b0d-5e8a-9c02-3348f1013233"] [:db/add "f816033f-048c-54d4-9ea4-06b8674b75bc" :question/answer-fields "771b5075-b99f-529e-9094-971809f385b4"] [:db/ensure "f816033f-048c-54d4-9ea4-06b8674b75bc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "f816033f-048c-54d4-9ea4-06b8674b75bc"] [:db/add "98397524-4310-5bbf-a49d-b54e54fad787" :answer/id #uuid "98397524-4310-5bbf-a49d-b54e54fad787"] [:db/add "98397524-4310-5bbf-a49d-b54e54fad787" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "98397524-4310-5bbf-a49d-b54e54fad787" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "98397524-4310-5bbf-a49d-b54e54fad787" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cf243eb7-4919-53e4-b186-56ac61f844e7" :answer-field/id #uuid "cf243eb7-4919-53e4-b186-56ac61f844e7"] [:db/add "cf243eb7-4919-53e4-b186-56ac61f844e7" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "cf243eb7-4919-53e4-b186-56ac61f844e7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "cf243eb7-4919-53e4-b186-56ac61f844e7" :answer-field/choices "98397524-4310-5bbf-a49d-b54e54fad787"] [:db/add "cf243eb7-4919-53e4-b186-56ac61f844e7" :answer-field/correct "98397524-4310-5bbf-a49d-b54e54fad787"] [:db/ensure "cf243eb7-4919-53e4-b186-56ac61f844e7" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c478314b-f83f-50ab-9113-2be69dac0b9a" :answer/id #uuid "c478314b-f83f-50ab-9113-2be69dac0b9a"] [:db/add "c478314b-f83f-50ab-9113-2be69dac0b9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c478314b-f83f-50ab-9113-2be69dac0b9a" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "c478314b-f83f-50ab-9113-2be69dac0b9a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d7c8288f-987d-5103-9e46-1d72d0a0d2eb" :answer-field/id #uuid "d7c8288f-987d-5103-9e46-1d72d0a0d2eb"] [:db/add "d7c8288f-987d-5103-9e46-1d72d0a0d2eb" :answer-field/key "field-2"] [:db/add "d7c8288f-987d-5103-9e46-1d72d0a0d2eb" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d7c8288f-987d-5103-9e46-1d72d0a0d2eb" :answer-field/choices "c478314b-f83f-50ab-9113-2be69dac0b9a"] [:db/add "d7c8288f-987d-5103-9e46-1d72d0a0d2eb" :answer-field/correct "c478314b-f83f-50ab-9113-2be69dac0b9a"] [:db/ensure "d7c8288f-987d-5103-9e46-1d72d0a0d2eb" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "42c77b65-0208-52fa-9e7f-27a9d66d0635" :question/id #uuid "42c77b65-0208-52fa-9e7f-27a9d66d0635"] [:db/add "42c77b65-0208-52fa-9e7f-27a9d66d0635" :question/problem "The vectors are drawn on a square grid: $\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\mathbf{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\mathbf{b}$, and $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\mathbf{c}$.\n\n![Vector diagram](images/81/81798006822ad1975ab7facc19a336b13c46db87fc8ded7284a6f6e1909cfc60.png)\n\nGiven that $\\mathbf{c}=\\lambda\\mathbf{a}+\\mu\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$ and $\\mu$.\n\n$\\lambda=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\mu=$ {{field-2}}"] [:db/add "42c77b65-0208-52fa-9e7f-27a9d66d0635" :question/worked-solution "![Completed vector route](images/89/8908558a5c4dea24cb2b5a48f05eeca14b4b84b9fcceee3975dd6ebcf686c60c.png)\n\nConstruct the route $O\\to X\\to C$, first parallel to $\\mathbf{a}$ and then parallel to $\\mathbf{b}$.\n\nAlong $OX$, move $2$ squares right and $1$ square up. A copy of $\\mathbf{a}$ moves $2$ squares right and $1$ square up. Thus $OX=1|\\mathbf{a}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{a}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{OX}=\\mathbf{a}$.\n\nAlong $XC$, move $1$ square right. A copy of $\\mathbf{b}$ moves $1$ square right. Thus $XC=1|\\mathbf{b}|$ and the segment points in the same direction to $\\mathbf{b}$. Hence $\\overrightarrow{XC}=\\mathbf{b}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c}&=\\overrightarrow{OX}+\\overrightarrow{XC}\\\\&=\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, their coefficients are unique. Matching coefficients gives $\\lambda=1$ and $\\mu=1$."] [:db/add "42c77b65-0208-52fa-9e7f-27a9d66d0635" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "42c77b65-0208-52fa-9e7f-27a9d66d0635" :question/answer-fields "cf243eb7-4919-53e4-b186-56ac61f844e7"] [:db/add "42c77b65-0208-52fa-9e7f-27a9d66d0635" :question/answer-fields "d7c8288f-987d-5103-9e46-1d72d0a0d2eb"] [:db/ensure "42c77b65-0208-52fa-9e7f-27a9d66d0635" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/questions "42c77b65-0208-52fa-9e7f-27a9d66d0635"] [:db/ensure 17592186096652 :knowledge-point/validate]]
